\subsection{Method \code{depth()}}{
Subscribe to the Order-Book Diff-Depth Stream

Subscribes to \verb{<symbol>@depth} — the full stream of order-book changes
(each message lists the bid/ask levels that changed; quantity \code{0} means the
level was removed). This is the data needed to maintain a complete local
order book, and the only order-book data Binance does \strong{not} archive, so
it must be streamed live.
\subsection{Official Documentation}{

\href{https://developers.binance.com/docs/binance-spot-api-docs/web-socket-streams#diff-depth-stream}{Depth stream}
}

